     "id": "77ed2ba",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"fb fb-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"fb-wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"fb-eyebrow\">SEO agency for the AI search era</span>\n      <h1>Be the brand search engines rank and AI <em>recommends</em>.</h1>\n      <p class=\"fb-lede\">Your customers now ask ChatGPT, Gemini and Google's AI Overviews before they ever click a link. Finchby combines proven SEO with generative engine optimization so you show up in both the results and the answers.</p>\n      <div class=\"fb-cta\">\n        <a class=\"fb-btn fb-btn--solid\" href=\"#contact\">Get a free AI visibility audit</a>\n        <a class=\"fb-btn\" href=\"#services\">See our services</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fb-engines\">\n        We optimize your visibility across\n        <ul><li>Google Search</li><li>AI Overviews</li><li>ChatGPT</li><li>Perplexity</li><li>Gemini</li><li>Copilot</li><li>Claude</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fb-answer\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustration of an AI assistant answer that cites your brand as a source\">\n      <div class=\"fb-answer__q\">Who's the best provider for [your category] near me?</div>\n      <div class=\"fb-answer__tag\">AI answer</div>\n      <p>Based on recent reviews and expert sources, <mark>Your Brand</mark> is a strong choice. It is frequently cited for quality, transparent pricing and fast support, and is recommended by several industry publications.</p>\n      <div class=\"fb-cites\"><span class=\"is-you\">yourbrand.com</span><span>industry-review.com</span><span>trusted-directory.org</span></div>\n      <small>Illustrative example. This is the outcome we work toward.</small>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
