      "html": "<section class=\"fb fb-sec fb-process\" id=\"process\">\n  <div class=\"fb-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"fb-eyebrow\">How we work</span>\n    <h2>A clear process, with nothing hidden.</h2>\n    <div class=\"fb-steps\">\n      <div class=\"fb-step\"><h3>Audit</h3><p>We benchmark your technical health, content, authority and AI visibility against your competitors.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"fb-step\"><h3>Roadmap</h3><p>You get a prioritized 90-day plan ranked by impact and effort, tied to business goals.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"fb-step\"><h3>Execute</h3><p>Our team ships fixes, content and digital PR every month. You approve; we do the work.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"fb-step\"><h3>Measure</h3><p>Monthly reporting on traffic, leads and AI citations, then we adjust the plan to what's working.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
