      "html": "<section class=\"fb fb-sec\" id=\"plans\">\n  <div class=\"fb-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"fb-eyebrow\">Plans</span>\n    <h2>Simple engagements that scale with you.</h2>\n    <!-- PLACEHOLDER PRICING: replace with real prices before launch -->\n    <div class=\"fb-plans\">\n      <div class=\"fb-plan\"><h3>Audit &amp; Roadmap</h3><div class=\"fb-plan__price\">$2,500 <span>one-time</span></div><p>Know exactly where you stand and what to do next.</p><ul><li>Technical SEO audit</li><li>AI search visibility audit</li><li>Competitor gap analysis</li><li>Prioritized 90-day roadmap</li></ul><a class=\"fb-btn\" href=\"#contact\">Start with an audit</a></div>\n      <div class=\"fb-plan fb-plan--pop\"><h3>Growth</h3><div class=\"fb-plan__price\">$3,500 <span>/ month</span></div><p>Ongoing SEO and GEO for growing businesses.</p><ul><li>Everything in Audit &amp; Roadmap</li><li>Monthly technical and on-page work</li><li>4 expert content pieces per month</li><li>Schema and entity optimization</li><li>AI visibility tracking and reporting</li></ul><a class=\"fb-btn fb-btn--solid\" href=\"#contact\">Talk to us</a></div>\n      <div class=\"fb-plan\"><h3>Authority</h3><div class=\"fb-plan__price\">Custom</div><p>For competitive markets and multi-location brands.</p><ul><li>Everything in Growth</li><li>Digital PR and link building</li><li>Local or e-commerce SEO at scale</li><li>Dedicated strategist</li><li>Quarterly executive reviews</li></ul><a class=\"fb-btn\" href=\"#contact\">Request a proposal</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
