     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"fb fb-sec fb-faq\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"fb-wrap\">\n    <div><span class=\"fb-eyebrow\">FAQ</span><h2>Questions we hear every week.</h2></div>\n    <div>\n      <details open><summary>Is SEO still worth it now that people use AI?</summary><p>Yes. AI assistants and AI Overviews draw on the same web that search engines index. Strong SEO is the foundation for being cited in AI answers, and traditional search still drives most website traffic.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>What is generative engine optimization (GEO)?</summary><p>GEO is the practice of improving how often and how accurately AI systems such as ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity mention and cite your brand. It builds on SEO with a focus on entities, citations and answer-ready content.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>How long until we see results?</summary><p>Technical fixes can show impact within weeks. Content and authority work typically compounds over three to six months. We set expectations in your roadmap and report progress monthly.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Can you guarantee rankings or AI citations?</summary><p>No one honestly can. We commit to a transparent plan, measurable work each month and reporting tied to leads and revenue.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Do you work with our existing website and team?</summary><p>Yes. We work with WordPress and most major platforms, and can implement changes ourselves or alongside your developers and writers.</p></details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
